<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces are conducting area domination exercises in Bandipora and Sopore along the Wullar axis while IGP Sujit Kumar warns that a single local terrorist remains active in Kashmir, sustaining the terror threat. In Manipur, hundreds rallied in Ukhrul demanding an end to ethnic violence and the SoO pact, Naga groups petitioned the prime minister for a political solution, and a Manipur PLA militant using a fake identity was arrested in Delhi. Maoist units in Chhattisgarh's Bijapur forest have hidden large caches, prompting forces to recover 711 grenade shells and a 5 kg pressure-cooker IED. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPYnhyS3ZKbmE0MkVmc3VYWk8yQ3RsRl9naFlITlZnZTd1WFF3WG5FWXNNeG1fa1dad2FTX3ViOHFCOHNTUi03XzB0RDVEbzd6UkFNeHM0dmwzY25jUGVJY1VLTWN2UFRBcm11azVqWUxHSUVPSFQ3MHpTcGtMN19yZ0NPSG9NLVdEWTNXdGgtT0hZeDNvZGt4TFVwTEV1ZEhLOG81WWFyS1VzbGlH?oc=5&quot;&gt;NorthEast India24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxObjA0TmM2ZDlodHdLejhWeTQtMzJHYjE2QVpmbEhTT2NsSEctSTBjVGhVVVpEYUFmOE1xZGFmVXozM3YzXzh5aW9XN01rZTY5bHVYQzc0U2ZsR01JQmpzV29wTEJ2QUI5S0h0X25oS1BaT3JzTHl0aUxvdmo4NVIzMHgyS3N6RFBTYkhlcnVCU1RWTlczSnpGTmhlQWJSRHhh?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indianmasterminds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan T